which is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence
(CC BY-SA 4.0).

The gold set quotes the corpus, so everything in this folder is shared under the same licence,
CC BY-SA 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

This applies to this folder only; it is not covered by the licence of the repository that
contains it.

Changes from the source: questions, reference answers and labels were written for evaluation;
evidence passages are quoted word for word from the corpus documents and tables.
